---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About" description="About Michał Michalski" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article class="prose">
				<h1>About Me</h1>
				<p>
					I'm Michał Michalski, a CTO & Lead AI Software Engineer based in Poznań, Poland.
				</p>
				<p>
					Currently, I'm leading <a href="https://www.intelliroom.ai/">IntelliRoom</a> - an AI-powered
					Due Diligence platform at T12 Inc. Previously, I co-founded Fractile, an agentic RAG platform
					for B2B customers, which was acquired by T12 in early 2025.
				</p>
				<p>
					I'm a hands-on engineering leader with experience building agentic automation, high-throughput
					data pipelines, and production-ready LLM systems. My tech stack includes Python, FastAPI,
					LangChain, PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, Kubernetes, and cloud platforms (Azure, AWS).
				</p>
				<p>
					Before my startup journey, I worked at Microsoft as a Software Engineer II, and held various
					senior engineering roles at companies like Samsung R&D, Nokia, and HP Enterprise.
				</p>

				<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Email: <a href="mailto:michal@buyuk-dev.com">michal@buyuk-dev.com</a></li>
					<li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/buyuk-dev">@buyuk-dev</a></li>
					<li>LinkedIn: <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/buyuk">buyuk</a></li>
					<li>Calendar: <a href="https://calendly.com/buyuk">Book a call</a></li>
				</ul>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
		<style>
			main {
				width: 720px;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
				margin: auto;
				padding: 1em;
			}
			.prose {
				color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
				line-height: 1.6;
			}
			.prose h1 {
				margin-bottom: 1em;
			}
			.prose h2 {
				margin-top: 2em;
				margin-bottom: 0.5em;
			}
			.prose ul {
				padding-left: 1.5em;
			}
			.prose li {
				margin-bottom: 0.5em;
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
